id: quick-shift
name: Quick Shift
advancement: true
prerequisite: Personality or Scholarship Score of 14+
tpCost: 15
# "The Action Cost is always 1 Standard Action and you treat the effects of the Shapeshift Maneuver as if you spent up to 3
# Actions (you decide how many)" - asked with the effects.
oneAction: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Shapeshift always at 1 Action, as if up to 3 were spent.
text: >
  Quick Shift: You are able to change your form with a mere thought.
  –Prerequisites: Personality or Scholarship Score of 14+
  –TP Cost: 15
  –Effect: When using the Shapeshift Maneuver, the Action Cost is always 1 Standard Action and you treat the effects of the
  Shapeshift Maneuver as if you spent up to 3 Actions (you decide how many).
